  "effect_entries": [
    {
      "effect": "Tenu: Permet à Tokorico, Tokopiyon, Tokotoro, et Tokopisco d'améliorer Ire de la Nature en Colère du Gardien d’Alola.",
      "short_effect": "Tenu: Permet aux Tapus d'améliorer Ire de la Nature en Colère du Gardien d'Alola.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "effect": "Held: Allows Tapu Koko, Tapu Lele, Tapu Bulu, and Tapu Fini to upgrade Nature’s Madness into Guardian of Alola.",
      "short_effect": "Held: Allows the Tapus to upgrade Nature’s Madness into Guardian of Alola.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "Ｚパワーの　けっしょう。\nカプたちの　しぜんのいかりを\nＺワザに　グレードアップする。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Z파워의 결정.\n카푸들의 자연의분노를\nZ기술로 업그레이드한다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ｚ力量的結晶。\n會把卡璞們的自然之怒\n升級為Ｚ招式。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une cristallisation de la Force Z, permettant\nde transformer l’Ire de la Nature d’un Toko\nen capacité Z.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Kristall, dem Z-Kraft innewohnt.\nEr stuft die Kapu-Attacke Naturzorn\nzu einer Z-Attacke auf.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cristal que confiere el Poder Z al movimiento\nFuria Natural de los Tapu.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cristallo in cui è immagazzinato il Potere Z.\nConsente di trasformare la mossa Ira della Natura\ndei Tapu in una mossa Z.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "This is a crystallized form of Z-Power. It upgrades\nthe tapu’s Nature’s Madness to a Z-Move.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
